ou are in position, checking back allows you to control the pot size and see the Turn card for free, potentially improving your hand or getting to a cheap showdown.\n\nReason: With bottom pair and a poor kicker on a board with high cards, your hand has marginal showdown value but cannot sustain heavy action. Checking is the optimal play to minimize loss and avoid getting raised off your equity.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
